 Bifurc brings together *.localhost mappings, proxy rules, traffic capture,
 mocks, and REST, GraphQL, SOAP, gRPC and WebSocket requests, kept as files
 in git-backed workspaces.
 .
 This package installs the interface, the engine and the bifurc command.
